  "id_authority": "Execution IDs in this file are canonical for V1.8-V2.3. `aliases` list the contract-embedded IDs (V2A-018a, V2B-019a, V23A-001 ...) and the coarse phase IDs of FUTURE_EXECUTION_GRAPH_V18_TO_V30.json so every name resolves to one node.",
  "cross_file_dependencies": "R-prefixed ids resolve in V17_RECOVERY_PACKET_QUEUE.json. A split packet there is satisfied when its split_into packets are satisfied.",
  "forward_compat_seams_from_v17": {
    "fence_reader_mapping": "R27c/R28b: effects.begin_execution compares a mapping supplied by the owning module inside the transaction. 18-04 adds key site_epoch; no gateway reorder.",
    "FenceState.authority": "R28b: reserved dict; 18-03/18-04 fill site_id/site_epoch/authority_digest.",
    "PolicyProvider.effective_scopes": "R28b: scope intersection point. 19-03 adds the project extension grant; V30A-004 digests the same intersection.",
    "AdapterRegistry": "R28c: only registration path. 19-03 registers validated extension adapters; 23-09 packs reuse it.",
    "AdapterManifest vocabulary": "R29a: strict subset of ExtensionManifest, so a built-in integration is the smallest extension.",
    "effect reservation `created` flag + CAS": "R27b: lets 23-04 DispatchIntent treat an effect reservation as an idempotently compensable component.",
    "unknown-effect path": "R27e: reused by 18-07 restore reconciliation and the V2.0 response-loss drill.",
